{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["מעשה עבות — since there are chains in another manner, woven one into the other like loops, therefore it is necessary to explain that these were not made so, but rather braided lengthwise like our ropes." "ונתתה את שרשרות העבותות על המשבצות — and he has not yet explained here in what place he is to set them. And further on he explains before us that the two ends of the chains he is to place in the rings of the breastpiece, and the two ends that are set in the filigree settings he is to place on the shoulder-pieces of the ephod, opposite its front."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:43:24.637173774Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}